# British English Big Boggle dictionary

`boggle-uk-scowl-60.txt` contains 86,935 uppercase alphabetic words of 4 through
25 letters. It is generated from the English Speller Database / SCOWL at size 60
using the British (`B`) spelling profile and variant level 1:

```text
./scowl --db scowl.db word-list 60 B 1 --deaccent --wo-poses=abbr --categories=
```

The generated output is filtered to alphabetic words only, uppercased, restricted
to 4 through 25 characters, and de-duplicated. This retains UK spellings such as
`COLOUR`, `ORGANISE`, and `THEATRE`.

Source: https://github.com/en-wl/wordlist

